sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Public user
    participant UI as Submission UI
    participant M as Feedback model
    participant S as Browser storage
    U->>UI: Submit feedback form
    UI->>UI: Validate form and photo
    break invalid fields or photo
        UI-->>U: Show errors#59; keep input
    end
    UI->>M: submit(input)
    M->>S: getItem(key)
    S-->>M: saved reports
    M->>M: ID + Submitted history
    M->>S: setItem(key, reports)
    alt storage write fails
        S-->>M: storage error
        M-->>UI: save error
        UI-->>U: Show error#59; keep input
    else write succeeds
        S-->>M: write completed
        M-->>UI: report with reference
        UI-->>U: Receipt and reference
    end
